<!doctype html>
<html lang="it"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Feedback Aomidori</title><link rel="icon" href="assets/feedback-favicon.png?v=__HASH__" type="image/png" sizes="32x32"><link rel="icon" href="assets/feedback-favicon.svg?v=__HASH__" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="feedback.css?v=__HASH__"><script src="feedback-cloud-config.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-cloud.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-zip.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-data.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-ui.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-nav.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-start.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script><script src="feedback-format.js?v=__HASH__" defer></script></head>
<body data-feedback="agent"><header class="intro"><div class="intro-title-row"><div class="intro-title"><p class="eyebrow">Aomidori · giro della __VERSION__</p><h1>Feedback Aomidori</h1></div></div><p class="intro-summary">Giro __VERSION__: collaudo chiuso. Le migliorie e le scelte dei giri precedenti sono in archivio.</p><nav class="intro-actions"><span class="intro-install"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/Roccobot/Aomidori/releases/download/v__VERSION__/Aomidori-__VERSION__.zip">Scarica e installa Aomidori __VERSION__</a><label class="installed-check" title="Sì, ho installato questa versione"><input type="checkbox" id="installed-confirm" aria-label="Sì, ho installato questa versione"> installata</label></span><span class="devices"><button type="button" id="devices-edit" class="devices-edit">modifica</button><span class="device-row"><span class="device-shown"><strong>Mac</strong>: <span id="device-shown"></span></span><button type="button" class="device-edit device-edit-mac" data-field="device" aria-label="Modifica il Mac"></button></span></span></nav></header><dialog id="devices-dialog" class="devices-dialog" aria-labelledby="devices-title"><form method="dialog"><h2 id="devices-title">Il tuo Mac</h2><label>Modello e versione di macOS<input id="device" placeholder="Per esempio: MacBook Pro M4, macOS 27"></label><div class="devices-actions"><button type="button" id="devices-cancel">Annulla</button><button type="submit" id="devices-ok">OK</button></div></form></dialog>
<aside class="dashboard" aria-label="Avanzamento"><div class="dash-row"><div id="counts"></div></div><progress id="progress" value="0" max="__TOTAL__" aria-label="Prove con risposta"></progress><p id="saved" role="status" aria-live="polite">Caricamento delle risposte...</p><p id="action-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></aside>
<div id="altro-overlay" class="altro-overlay" hidden><div class="altro-overlay-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Altro"><section class="altro-overlay-body"><label class="sr-only" for="notes-mobile">Altro</label><textarea id="notes-mobile" rows="12"></textarea><label id="altro-overlay-attach" class="altro-attach" aria-label="Allega file o trascinali qui"><span class="altro-attach-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span><input class="images" aria-label="Allega file o trascinali qui" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif,image/svg+xml,.svg,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed,.zip" multiple></label></section><div class="image-list"></div></div></div>

<main><div class="feedback-columns"><div class="feedback-primary"><section class="tests" aria-label="Prove del giro __VERSION__"><div id="tests">__CARDS__</div></section>__QUESTIONS__<section id="labels" hidden><h2>Etichette testuali</h2><p>Testi italiani nuovi di questo giro. Una correzione sostituisce la proposta al prossimo rilascio utile. Non è una prova di collaudo.</p><div id="label-list"></div></section>__CONCLUDED__</div><section class="card extra" id="extra-section"><h2>Altro</h2><label class="altro-notes-label"><textarea id="notes" rows="7" aria-label="Altro"></textarea></label><label id="altro-attach" class="altro-attach" aria-label="Allega file o trascinali qui"><span class="altro-attach-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span><input class="images" aria-label="Allega file o trascinali qui" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif,image/svg+xml,.svg,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed,.zip" multiple></label><div class="altro-commands" role="group" aria-label="Consegna"><button type="button" class="command" id="reset" data-command="reset" title="Azzera tutto" aria-label="Azzera tutto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M8 6V4h8v2"/><path d="M19 6l-1 14H6L5 6"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="command" id="copy" data-command="copy" title="Copia il riepilogo" aria-label="Copia il riepilogo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 8h9a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z"/><path d="M5 16H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="command" id="export" data-command="export" title="Esporta" aria-label="Esporta"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg></button><label class="command file-button" data-command="import" title="Importa"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M17 8l-5-5-5 5"/><path d="M12 3v12"/></svg><input id="import" type="file" accept="application/zip,.zip,application/json,.json" aria-label="Importa"></label><button type="button" class="command" id="save" data-command="save" title="Salva" aria-label="Salva"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3h12l4 4v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/><path d="M7 3v6h10V3M7 21v-8h10v8M14 5v2"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="command" id="send" data-command="send" title="Invia" aria-label="Invia"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 2 11 13"/><path d="M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7Z"/></svg></button></div><div class="image-list"></div></section>__NEXT_STEPS__</div></main><div class="floating-controls" aria-label="Navigazione e salvataggio"><button id="first-empty" type="button" aria-label="Primo riquadro non compilato" title="Primo riquadro non compilato" hidden><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" version="1.1" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5M20 5v14"/></svg></button><button id="previous-card" type="button" aria-label="Riquadro precedente" title="Riquadro precedente"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" version="1.1" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20V4m-6 6 6-6 6 6M5 4h14"/></svg></button><button id="next-card" type="button" aria-label="Riquadro successivo" title="Riquadro successivo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" version="1.1" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6M5 20h14"/></svg></button><button id="floating-save" type="button" aria-label="Salva le risposte" title="Salva le risposte"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" version="1.1" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3h12l4 4v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/><path d="M7 3v6h10V3M7 21v-8h10v8M14 5v2"/></svg></button><span id="navigation-position" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div><script id="feedback-data" type="application/json">__DATA__</script></body></html>
